---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Blog
permalink: /blog/
description: Blog Go2Cloud — SOLIDWORKS, 3DEXPERIENCE et la pratique CAO avec les outils Dassault Systèmes.
---
<section class="blog-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="blog-head">
      <span class="blog-eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span> Blog</span>
      <h1 class="blog-h1">Conseils, retours et nouveautés du monde CAO.</h1>
      <p class="blog-lede">SOLIDWORKS, 3DEXPERIENCE et le quotidien avec les outils Dassault — expliqués concrètement.</p>
      <div class="blog-cats">
        <a class="blog-cat is-active" href="/blog/">Tous</a>
        {% for c in collections.categories %}
        <a class="blog-cat" href="/blog/categorie/{{ c.slug }}/">{{ c.name }} ({{ c.count }})</a>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="blog-grid">
      {% for post in collections.post %}
      <a class="blog-card" href="{{ post.url }}">
        {% if post.data.cover %}<div class="blog-card__img"><img src="{{ post.data.cover }}" alt="" loading="lazy" /></div>{% endif %}
        <div class="blog-card__body">
          <span class="blog-card__cat">{{ post.data.category }}</span>
          <h3 class="blog-card__title">{{ post.data.title }}</h3>
          <p class="blog-card__excerpt">{{ post.data.excerpt }}</p>
          <span class="blog-card__meta">{{ post.date | dateFR }}</span>
        </div>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
      {% if collections.post.length == 0 %}
      <p style="color:var(--c-text-dim);">Bientôt plus — le premier article est en préparation.</p>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
